[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13202.429, "timestamp": "03:40:02", "text": "一。呃，我想要那笔钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13206.349, "timestamp": "03:40:06", "text": "我会在改版中完成这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13212.03, "timestamp": "03:40:12", "text": "嗯嗯，五点以后，三四点以后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13215.91, "timestamp": "03:40:15", "text": "年。呃，钱一。我想要那部手机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13219.03, "timestamp": "03:40:19", "text": "等等，就像 Shto 那样。有东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13221.75, "timestamp": "03:40:21", "text": "我在下一个版本中加入了它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13224.07, "timestamp": "03:40:24", "text": "模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13226.87, "timestamp": "03:40:26", "text": "是的，我并没有要求这样做，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13230.79, "timestamp": "03:40:30", "text": "阿蒂斯玛·马马桑有它。呃，我的确问过……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.269, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "还有一些意想不到的额外东西"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13243.292, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@NINJA, Joq's Concert Plate its joq's fav expression"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13243.349, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "text": "她还会补充道。那是舌头。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13247.429, "timestamp": "03:40:47", "text": "舌头，对吧？我现在有舌头了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13250.55, "timestamp": "03:40:50", "text": "所以，那双火热的眼睛和红晕……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13259.349, "timestamp": "03:40:59", "text": "像盖子一样的表情。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13259.5, "timestamp": "03:40:59", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yes, joq loves it very much"}]